{"unit_id":"988hj7tczd-oss__dsh-pr-description#card-zh","repo":"988hj7tczd-oss/dsh-pr-description","commit":"7608cb9b7b61447a3aff14491537ba7ee8caad6b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pr-description 是 DSH 工具插件，可比较当前 Git 分支与基线并生成 PR 标题、变更说明和自审清单。它注册 pr_describe 工具，汇总文件与行数、提取新增符号，按中英文模板输出 Markdown，默认写入 PR_DESCRIPTION.md。可指定基线和输出路径，也可确认后生成或调用 gh CLI 创建 PR；适合准备 PR 文案的开发者，需本地 Git 仓库。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:41-48","src/tools/pr-describe.ts:129-170","src/tools/pr-describe.ts:221-268"]}
